          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"interactive-perception-workbench\">Interactive perception workbench</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The native window has raw/processed views, controls and image picking.\nKeep the session and viewer cells alive. Replace only processing or extra\nGUI callbacks. Inspect <code>workbench.status()</code> and <code>viewer.status()</code>.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">For 3D, create <code>scene = ViserViewer(workbench, port=8768)</code> in a new cell.\nReturn <code>points</code> and optional <code>colors</code> alongside <code>image</code> from processing.\nClose <code>scene</code>, <code>viewer</code>, then <code>workbench</code> when finished.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
